    "show_share": true,
    "description": "More than 400,000 people suffer from a stroke every year in Pakistan. A third of the victims do not survive and about half become dependent on others,\" Dr Muhammad Wasay, Consultant Neurologist, Aga Khan University (AKU) informed the audience at AKU's awareness programme.",
